      "title_at_revision": "Supplementary conditions for ski-planes",
      "text": "In determining ground loads for ski-planes and assuming that the aeroplane is resting on the ground with one main ski frozen at rest and the other skis free to slide, a limit side force equal to 0\u00b7036 times the design maximum weight must be applied near the tail assembly with a factor of safety of 1.",
